Ported from the TypeScript build's __tests__/cases/typescript/008-glob-view-brace-pattern.case.yaml; expected output is the TypeScript build's.
Its source-code inputs were rewritten as Markdown files.
Except: the glob view says "a header or summary" instead of "header comments" (docs/changelog.md).
== args
input/{one,two}.md
== file input/one.md
---
description: First summary.
---
# one
== file input/two.md
---
description: Second summary.
---
# two
== stdout
glob view: input/{one,two}.md
Includes only a header or summary per file.
For file-level outlines, use `outln [FILE]...`.
input/one.md: description: "First summary."
input/two.md: description: "Second summary."
== stderr
== exit 0
